<p class="lede">
This page lists the companies the research sources tie to the developer by control number, address or agent name. It gives what each record says and does not say who owns or runs any of them.
</p>

<div class="notice-box">
<strong>Scope:</strong>
Every Georgia field below is from OpenCorporates, a mirror of the Georgia Secretary of State's registry. The state's own business search refused every request (a bot check), so no Georgia record was read at the registry itself. The mirror hides officer names and formation dates behind a login, which was not used. The Alabama records were read at the Alabama registry itself. A listing here is a tie by control number, address or agent name, not a statement about who owns a company.
</div>

<h2>What the Record Says</h2>

<h3>The entities</h3>

<p>From a registry mirror unless marked; the state's records were not read.</p>

<p>Tie for each Georgia entity on the site's list: the control number is on the site's list, plus the address 249 Milton Ave SE. Formation dates are each record's "Business Formation" filing line on the mirror, confirmed by the source checker for all fourteen. All fourteen show "Active/Compliance" with a 2026 annual-registration line on the mirror as read October 7, 2026. The site's own earlier list shows "Active/Owes Current Year AR" for each, except Abebe Cox Ventures LLC (below).</p>

