<p>For the older entities the mirror shows at most eight filing lines, so earlier lines were not seen. The mirror's separate officer-search list (the source analyst's read; not reproduced by the checker; the company pages themselves hide officers) prints the developer's name as organizer or agent, and for ABEBE, INC. also as "ceo, cfo, secretary". No other person's name was seen on these records.</p>

<h3>Dissolution and reinstatement dates</h3>

<p>Among the Georgia entities on the site's list, one has them. For Abebe Cox Ventures LLC (24086945) the mirror prints these filing lines: "8 Apr 2024 Name Reservation"; "19 Apr 2024 Business Formation"; "18 Jun 2025 Notice of Admin. Dissolution/Revocation"; "19 Sep 2025 Administrative Dissolution"; "18 May 2026 Reinstatement" (printed twice). It shows "Status Active/Compliance" and "Agent Name Mike Abebe". The mirror does not state a reason for the dissolution.</p>

<p>The site's earlier list shows this entity as "Admin. Dissolved" with a different agent.</p>

<p>One entity not on the site's list also has such dates. For 441 VENTURES LLC (12034847) the mirror prints "17 Feb 2025 Reinstatement", "30 Sep 2021 Administrative Dissolution" and "13 Apr 2012 Business Formation", with "Agent Name Abebe, Mike" and "Active/Compliance".</p>

<h3>Alabama, read at the registry</h3>

<p>The Alabama Secretary of State's entity detail pages (arc-sos.state.al.us; the exact page addresses are not recorded in the source) show two entities. Abebe Blackbelt Ventures LLC, 000-866-410: "Formation Date 06/08/2021"; "Status Exists"; "Organizer Name Mike, Abebe"; "Organizer Street Address 249 Milton Ave SE Atlanta, GA 30315"; a registered-agent change dated 10/02/2024. Tie: the organizer address.</p>

<p>Ensley District Developers, LLC, 000-589-337: "Formation Date 10/08/2019"; "Status Exists"; "Registered Agent Name C T Corporation System". The record names no individual. Tie: the entity name in the 2019 article the site already holds; nothing in the record itself.</p>

<h3>Federal small-business loan records</h3>

<p>USAspending.gov records for two recipients, opened October 6, 2026 (<a href="https://api.usaspending.gov/api/v2/recipient/fe6706db-e5d5-ca94-3403-b8e4c1229abc-R/" target="_blank">recipient record for Abebe Ventures LLC</a>). That record shows Abebe Ventures LLC at 249 MILTON AVE SE, Atlanta GA 30315, with the business type "small_business". Source: the deep-dive research file, a secondary file.</p>

